  "launch_notes": "Launch on 32x H100/A100-80G (4 nodes x 8 GPU) with: --num-experts 8 --moe-token-dispatcher all-gather --moe-router-topk 2 --moe-aux-loss-coeff 0.01 --swiglu --bf16 --recompute-granularity full --recompute-method uniform. EP=8 keeps one expert replica per rank group (DP=4), so the 8-expert layer spans 8 GPUs and attention is replicated across the group; no TP needed at this size, keeping all-to-all expert traffic to a single node boundary if EP group is placed on one node. Total params ~2.6B (active ~1B). Set --num-layers-per-virtual-pipeline-stage for memory headroom only if micro-batch 2 overflows; activation recomputation is assumed in the memory figure. Throughput assumes ~60% MFU on H100 with top-2 all-gather dispatch."
