Design rationale: 16 layers × hidden 2048 with 8 experts, top-2, and expert FFN of 4096 gives ~1B active params (top-2 × 2·H·d_ff per layer ≈ 50M/layer → ~0.9B plus embeddings), with ~2.6B total. Capacity factor 1.25 absorbs token-skew before dropping tokens.